<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43999" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔθηρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήρα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lucky</i> or <i>successful in hunting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1253
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔθηρος ὀρνέων ἵρηξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					72.21
				</span></i>
			 (cj.); of Pan, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.185
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Zos.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔθηροι, οἱ</span>, club of <i>sportsmen</i> at Pergamum, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.Mitt.</u>
				33.409
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. ἄγρη</span>
			<i>successful</i> sport, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.27
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Theaet.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				253
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὔ</span>. <i>good
			sport</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.114
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. κάλαμοι</span>
			<i>successful</i> fishing-rods, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.89
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maec.
			</span></i>); <i>successful as bait</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				12.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήρ</span>) <i>abounding in game, good for
				hunting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					14.1.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.268
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mnasalc.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. καὶ εὐίχθυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>.</div>
